{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15262040","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15262040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1526204001:1":{"text":"아쿠보르는 보칼리스에게 밀밭에 다가오지 말라고 경고했는데, 왜 온 것이냐!","source_cn":"雅库伯尔已经警告过呼临，不准再靠近麦田。你们来做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14BC30A7D80D8612","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1526204002:1":{"text":"그, 그게... 길을 잘못 들어서...","source_cn":"我、我们……不小心走错路了，就……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16CB6391170368B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1526204003:1":{"text":"사실대로 말해라..","source_cn":"说真话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A1841F47E447FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1526204004:1":{"text":"아무 것도 안 가져갔어요! 아니, 정말 훔칠 생각이 없었어요! 그러니까 저희를 보내주세요!","source_cn":"我们什么都没拿！不是，我们也没想拿什么！放过我们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x822764868E22F4F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1526204005:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">밀을 훔치려고</style> 한 거 아니냐!","source_cn":"你们想<style=highlight>窃取小麦</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48355959082921D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1526204006:1":{"text":"아... 아니에요!","source_cn":"我……我们没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4431C37415C18A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1526204007:1":{"text":"그럼 가방에 이건 무엇이지?","source_cn":"那你包里的是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA9413002B5F542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1526204008:1":{"text":"죄송해요... 너, 너무 배가 고파서... 어쩔 수 없이...","source_cn":"对不起……我、我们太饿了，实在受不了，只能……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4DD9FBF7D946325","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1526204009:1":{"text":"“배가 고프다”? 물안개 영지에서 약속대로 제때 보칼리스로 밀을 보내는데, 왜 굶고 있는 것이냐.","source_cn":"饿？水泽营地一直按期将小麦送到呼临城，为什么你们还会挨饿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E950D5D5344639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1526204010:1":{"text":"...밀이 너무 적어요. 저희가 받는 건 더 적고요.","source_cn":"……你们送来的小麦太少了，分到我们手里的更是一次比一次少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EE1674A6E02FED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1526204011:1":{"text":"물론, 있는 것만 해도 감사해야 하는 건 알지만, 저희처럼 아이가 많은 집은... 누군가 굶을 수밖에 없어요...","source_cn":"虽然说是有的吃就不错，但像我们这种家里孩子多的，难免还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A8E632EF533BD8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1526204012:1":{"text":"물안개 영지의 밀밭 수확이 좋지 않은 건 아쿠보르의 책임이 아니라, 풍요의 신이 보낸 가시 메뚜기 때문이다.","source_cn":"水泽营地的麦田收成不好。这不是雅库伯尔的责任，而是因为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79B72C2F46E34D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1526204013:1":{"text":"방금도 보았겠지만, 가시 메뚜기가 물안개 영지를 습격한 게 오늘만 해도 벌써 세 번째다.","source_cn":"你们刚刚也看到了针蝗，它们已经是今天袭击水泽营地的第三波。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25830F5879CC9D6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1526204014:1":{"text":"...하지만 저희도 어쩔 수 없었어요.","source_cn":"……但是我们没有其他办法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2C45BAB1187B985","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1526204015:1":{"text":"아이가... 굶는 걸 도저히 두고만 볼 수는 없었어요. 얼마나 말랐는지...","source_cn":"我……我不能看着我的孩子再挨饿了，他那么瘦小……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BD2BCD6D5EBE102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1526204016:1":{"text":"잡으려면 절 잡아가세요! 하지만 아이에게 뭐라도 먹일 수 있도록 아이렌은 보내주세요.","source_cn":"你要抓就抓我吧！只求你让伊莲把小麦带回去，让她的孩子饱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EAEA609452A09C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1526204017:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1526204018:1":{"text":"짐을 들고 당장 샛길로 빠져나가라.","source_cn":"拿上你们的包裹，走小路离开这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05B92DA85552A9AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1526204018":{"text":"짐을 들고 당장 샛길로 빠져나가라.","source_cn":"拿上你们的包裹，走小路离开这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05B92DA85552A9AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1526204019:1":{"text":"보, 보내주시는 건가요?!","source_cn":"你……你要放我们走？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x300D8CF1AD909274","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1526204020:1":{"text":"단, 이 일을 보칼리스인이든 아쿠보르인이든, 그 누구에게도 말하지 마라.","source_cn":"有一个要求：不准和任何人提起这件事。无论是呼临人，还是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FFA222C38365304","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1526204021:1":{"text":"만약 약속을 어긴다면, 이 창으로 당신들을 추적해 벌을 내리겠다.","source_cn":"如果你们食言，我会用这支矛追踪你们，让你们受到应受的惩罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20CF9D04CB9BB424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1526204022:1":{"text":"절대로 말 안 할게요. 맹세하겠습니다!","source_cn":"不不不！我们不会说的，我保证！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0937620978749261","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1526204023:1":{"text":"감사합니다... 정말 감사합니다!","source_cn":"谢谢……谢谢你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x742946175E21F8F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"...뭐?!","source_cn":"……嗯？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF6DD60FF45EE28","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...뭐?!","female":"...뭐?!","variant_male_record_index":"80987","variant_female_record_index":"80988","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:那非":{"text":"나페이","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼临居民伊莲":{"text":"보칼리스 주민 아이렌","source":"呼临居民伊莲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼临居民瓦罗":{"text":"보칼리스 주민 바루","source":"呼临居民瓦罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_ro